# DeepSeek API key for Damage Estimation (never commit real keys).
# Dev: copy to `.env` in this folder.
# Packaged builds: key present in `.env` (or the shell) when you run `npm run build` / `dist`
# is embedded into the app so installers work without a per-machine .env.
# Optional override after install: place a `.env` next to the .exe or in the app userData folder.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
